Build libxcvt as whatever default_library asks for (static here).

lib/meson.build hardcodes shared_library(), which a static-only toolchain cannot
link; library() honours -Ddefault_library=static.

--- a/lib/meson.build
+++ b/lib/meson.build
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 libxcvt_sources = ['libxcvt.c']
-libxcvt = shared_library('xcvt',
+libxcvt = library('xcvt',
                          libxcvt_sources,
                          include_directories : inc,
                          version: meson.project_version(),
